          "source_text_sha256": "18d5f18af63f0faf8d40a6fd9956e9dc69d61e1df9312fcea503582ec8b3e8e6",
          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of a blue-tinged conical light form surrounded by a halo: gas cloud resulting from the passivation of the upper cryogenic stage (ESC-A) of the Ariane VA225 launch vehicle.",
